[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21700100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21700100_02_0010","text":"哇——！\n这里就是我们的房间吗！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21700100_02_0020","text":"好大……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21700100_02_0030","text":"浴室也好大哦～！\n感觉超厉害的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21700100_02_0040","text":"算是当偶像的福利呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21700100_02_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21700100_02_0060","text":"选哪张床好呢…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21700100_02_0070","text":"……咦，朝日酱\n怎么突然安静了，怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21700100_02_0080","text":"……喂，朝日？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21700100_02_0090","text":"不许往床上扑哦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21700100_02_0100","text":"我想知道哪张床弹得最高嘛——"}]
